    "detailed_description": "Lux is a 2D platformer that follows Lou, a girl who discovers a magic lantern in her attic. Full of quirky characters and a whole lot of puns, explore the town of Idelham, and discover the darkness that lurks under the surface. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis game features: <br />\r\n- Solve puzzles<br />\r\n- Ton of fun local characters (including many OCs designed by our community!)<br />\r\n- A bunch of mini games<br />\r\n- Unfolding story <br />\r\n- Basic platforming<br />\r\n- Gorgeous frame by frame animation and carefully done background art<br />\r\n- Observe various things<br />\r\n- Unobserve them immediately",
